   "source": [
    "## Continue Statement\n",
    "The continue statement skips the rest of the loop statements and causes the next iteration to occur.\n",
    "## example\n",
    "```python\n",
    "for i in [2,3,4,6,8,0]:\n",
    "    if (i%2!=0):\n",
    "        continue\n",
    "    print(i)\n",
    "  ```\n",
    "  ## output\n",
    "  ```\n",
    "2\n",
    "4\n",
    "6\n",
    "8\n",
    "0\n",
    "\n",
    "```"
   ]
  }
 ],
